insert into wm.catalog_registry(catalog_id,variant,catalog_version,snapshot,digest) select s->>'id',s->>'variant',s->>'catalog_version',s,wm.hash_json(s) from (values('{"schema":3,"site_required":true,"care_kind":null,"production":true,"basic_measurement_included":true,"advanced_measurement":false,"onboarding_only":false,"id":"grow","variant":"production","name":"Local Search Partnership","service_type":"seo","catalog_version":"2026-10-29-v4-offers:workspace-3","currency":"USD","scope":["One location and one primary service market; up to 30 supported marketing pages. $349/month production only, $449 with Brochure Care or $595 with Commerce Care. Supported stores receive service/information-page work, not product/category ecommerce SEO.","An initial 90-day topic and local-presence plan; monthly Search Console/GA4/profile review where data are available. Track up to 10 agreed non-branded query themes, without presenting unstable ranking checks as guaranteed results.","Five new researched articles or useful service pages each month, using the existing supported design and publishing setup. Each answers one agreed buyer question or service purpose. Content length follows the topic, reader and search intent, without a fixed word quota. Each complete article counts once; research, publishing and checks are not separate deliverables.","Each article includes topic and search-intent research, original writing from checked sources and client expertise, factual review, page title and headings, relevant internal links, publishing, and readability/mobile/link checks. One consolidated client review round is included. Client-specific claims and proof need approval before publication.","Monthly accuracy review of one Google Business Profile; up to five simple data/service/hour updates and up to five owner-approved review-reply drafts where there are reviews to answer.","Check up to five agreed priority business listings; submit up to one correction where access permits. Submissions and approvals are reported separately.","A written monthly strategy review (or optional 30-minute appointment) and report on completed work, available impressions/clicks/inquiries, attribution limits and next priorities.","Write and publish up to two short owner-approved Google profile update posts monthly, using existing approved facts/assets. This replaces the former conditional outreach/substitute-listing activity.","One additional bounded conversion improvement: refine one call-to-action section, confirmation message or existing ordinary form/journey component. Agree one specific acceptance check; implement and regression-test it within the existing design. No new integration, calculator, page or A/B-test campaign. This is additional to all five articles.","When Brochure Care is selected, the shared hosting-offset rule covers up to $25/month of documented eligible hosting. Commerce and production-only variants have no hosting offset.","For the first three approved introductory production clients, Care onboarding is included when Care is chosen. The first cycle also includes missing supported native GA4/Search Console setup and one inquiry event; advanced measurement remains separate. All production outputs are still due in that paid cycle.","Before renewal, check whether the next five pages exceed supported limits. Agree any scope or fee expansion before payment, or do not renew. Every accepted cycle still includes all five outputs. Care keeps its separate coverage limits."],"exclusions":["Multiple locations, national SEO, large ecommerce SEO or unlimited pages","Bulk/paid links, guaranteed rankings, review incentives or guaranteed lead/revenue increases","Social content calendars, multi-channel posting campaigns, advertising and email campaigns","Link outreach is excluded from this revised package. It is not quietly retained alongside the lower price.","New publishing platforms, custom page templates, original field research, specialist professional verificati